{"4282200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Pharma Craft", "steam_appid": 4282200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pharma Craft </strong>is a crafting and research simulation where you build your own laboratory from the ground up. You start small, set up workstations, source raw materials, and gradually develop new processes, formulas, and products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and production are at the heart of the game: unlock new recipes, gather the required ingredients, optimize your workflows, and turn simple materials into valuable goods. Whatever you invent, you can produce in batches, improve quality and efficiency, and sell your results to expand your lab even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>customer orders</strong> and supply different buyers such as <strong>pharmacies and hospitals</strong>. Different customers pay different prices and have specific demands—choose what to produce, manage your ingredients, and deliver reliably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your lab step by step, expand your production chain, and turn research into a working business—precise, efficient, and always one step ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and expand your lab</strong> with specialized workstations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research progression:</strong> unlock new recipes, processes, and improved methods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting-focused production:</strong> multi-step workflows that turn simple ingredients into valuable goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Batch manufacturing:</strong> improve quality and efficiency over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer orders:</strong> decide what to produce next based on demand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply the town and region:</strong> deliver to nearby buyers with different needs and prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step-by-step rebuilding:</strong> repair, extend, and modernize buildings in clear stages—nothing appears out of nowhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear management systems:</strong> track income, expenses, storage, and production chains with transparent numbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm, consequence-driven gameplay:</strong> no frantic timer, but decisions matter—careless spending keeps you small; careful planning builds a stable lab over time</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pharma Craft </strong>is a crafting and research simulation where you build your own laboratory from the ground up. You start small, set up workstations, source raw materials, and gradually develop new processes, formulas, and products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research and production are at the heart of the game: unlock new recipes, gather the required ingredients, optimize your workflows, and turn simple materials into valuable goods. Whatever you invent, you can produce in batches, improve quality and efficiency, and sell your results to expand your lab even further.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on <strong>customer orders</strong> and supply different buyers such as <strong>pharmacies and hospitals</strong>. Different customers pay different prices and have specific demands—choose what to produce, manage your ingredients, and deliver reliably.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your lab step by step, expand your production chain, and turn research into a working business—precise, efficient, and always one step ahead.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and expand your lab</strong> with specialized workstations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Research progression:</strong> unlock new recipes, processes, and improved methods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting-focused production:</strong> multi-step workflows that turn simple ingredients into valuable goods</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Batch manufacturing:</strong> improve quality and efficiency over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customer orders:</strong> decide what to produce next based on demand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supply the town and region:</strong> deliver to nearby buyers with different needs and prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Step-by-step rebuilding:</strong> repair, extend, and modernize buildings in clear stages—nothing appears out of nowhere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clear management systems:</strong> track income, expenses, storage, and production chains with transparent numbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Calm, consequence-driven gameplay:</strong> no frantic timer, but decisions matter—careless spending keeps you small; careful planning builds a stable lab over time</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Pharma Craft: Build your lab from the ground up, research new recipes, optimize production chains, and craft valuable products. Produce in batches, improve quality, and sell your results to keep expanding.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Brazil<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Dutch<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Swedish<strong>*</strong>, Czech<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong>, Ukrainian<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4282200/6f65d66b457622a7fc05ef4982b9453c0bc7b17f/header.jpg?t=1778152128", "c